Sarge does not support MILO because Sarge only installs from SRM console 
(no MILO support). To install Sarge on a MILO/ARC-only only machine first 
install Woody and then "apt-get dist-upgrade" to Sarge. But better would be 
to change to SRM and then install Sarge from netinst-cd.

